WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:17.242
My master wanted to get as much money as he could from showing me.

2
00:00:18.163 --> 00:00:23.245
He decided to take me and Glumdalclitch to the capital of Brobdingnag.

3
00:00:24.165 --> 00:00:29.147
"We'll stop at every town along the way," I heard him say to his wife.

4
00:00:30.208 --> 00:00:33.217
He was greedy, and I had begun to dislike him.

5
00:00:34.298 --> 00:00:37.760
One August morning, we set off for the capital city.

6
00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:45.784
We stopped often, and Glumdalclitch took me out of my traveling box to let me stretch and see

7
00:00:45.824 --> 00:00:46.745
the countryside.

8
00:00:47.605 --> 00:00:54.429
Our trip lasted ten weeks, and I performed in 18 large towns and many villages.

9
00:00:55.630 --> 00:00:57.771
Finally, we reached the capital.

10
00:00:59.516 --> 00:01:05.720
Again my master rented a meeting room in a hotel and made me perform at least ten times

11
00:01:06.221 --> 00:01:06.781
every day.

12
00:01:07.461 --> 00:01:09.102
Crowds lined up to see me.

13
00:01:09.843 --> 00:01:15.226
As the weeks passed I became more and more exhausted and lost a lot of weight.

14
00:01:16.207 --> 00:01:21.050
I looked so terrible that my master began to think that I would die soon.

15
00:01:21.070 --> 00:01:25.874
"I might as well get rid of you," he said unkindly.

16
00:01:25.894 --> 00:01:29.276
"You will be no use to me when you are dead."

17
00:01:30.444 --> 00:01:33.766
One day, a messenger arrived from the palace nearby.

18
00:01:33.786 --> 00:01:39.848
"You are ordered to come to the palace with your creature," said the messenger to my master.

19
00:01:39.868 --> 00:01:43.249
"The queen and her ladies want to be entertained."

20
00:01:44.150 --> 00:01:46.171
We went to the palace immediately.

21
00:01:47.131 --> 00:01:51.353
A servant showed us into the room where the queen and her ladies were waiting.

22
00:01:52.293 --> 00:01:57.155
I kneeled down in front of the queen, and asked for the honor of kissing her foot.

23
00:01:58.956 --> 00:02:01.357
Instead, the queen held out her little finger to me.

24
00:02:01.377 --> 00:02:05.700
"You may kiss my finger," she said.

25
00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:12.964
I bowed, kissed her finger, and said, "It is a great honor to meet you, Your Majesty."

26
00:02:12.984 --> 00:02:18.467
"Tell me about your country and your travels," she said.

27
00:02:19.387 --> 00:02:26.971
She showed great interest as I talked, and then she asked me a surprising question: "Would you like

28
00:02:27.031 --> 00:02:29.153
to live here in the palace?"

29
00:02:30.433 --> 00:02:34.636
I bowed again and replied, "That is not for me to decide.

30
00:02:35.356 --> 00:02:36.797
I must serve my master."

31
00:02:36.817 --> 00:02:39.938
"Will you sell your creature?"

32
00:02:40.739 --> 00:02:42.019
she asked my master.

33
00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:48.703
Since he thought I was dying anyway, he was happy to accept a thousand pieces of gold in

34
00:02:48.763 --> 00:02:49.644
exchange for me.

35
00:02:49.664 --> 00:02:57.628
"Your Majesty," I said politely to the queen, "Glumdalclitch looks after me and teaches me well.

36
00:02:58.464 --> 00:02:59.745
Could she stay here too?"

37
00:02:59.765 --> 00:03:02.226
"Will you allow this, farmer?"

38
00:03:02.906 --> 00:03:04.447
the queen asked my master.

39
00:03:04.467 --> 00:03:08.428
"She may stay if she wants to," he replied.

40
00:03:09.148 --> 00:03:11.629
Glumdalclitch could hardly hide her joy.

41
00:03:12.330 --> 00:03:14.731
My master said good-bye to me and his daughter.

42
00:03:15.651 --> 00:03:18.112
As he was leaving, I bowed to him slightly.

43
00:03:18.132 --> 00:03:23.094
"You seem cold toward your master," the queen observed.

44
00:03:23.794 --> 00:03:24.735
"Tell me why."

45
00:03:25.575 --> 00:03:30.969
With some hesitation, I said, "Your Majesty, he has worked me hard."

46
00:03:31.950 --> 00:03:36.772
And I explained what my master had made me do so that he could get rich.

47
00:03:37.612 --> 00:03:41.514
My story interested her, and she carried me to see the king.

48
00:03:42.374 --> 00:03:45.075
He seemed a serious and intelligent man.

49
00:03:45.956 --> 00:03:48.957
At first he thought I might be some sort of machine.

50
00:03:49.757 --> 00:03:53.659
He did not believe that someone of my size could be human.

51
00:03:54.379 --> 00:03:58.822
When I began to speak, however, the king could not hide his amazement.

52
00:03:59.563 --> 00:04:03.626
The queen asked me to tell my story all over again.

53
00:04:05.307 --> 00:04:09.871
The king was so impressed that he sent for his three best scholars.

54
00:04:10.672 --> 00:04:14.415
They asked me many questions and discussed my answers at length.

55
00:04:15.256 --> 00:04:17.838
They decided that I could not be a human.

56
00:04:17.858 --> 00:04:25.204
"There are millions of people my size in England," I explained, "but no one of your size."

57
00:04:25.940 --> 00:04:28.562
The scholars just smiled in disbelief.

58
00:04:29.462 --> 00:04:33.885
After they left, the king asked me and Glumdalclitch many questions.

59
00:04:34.346 --> 00:04:37.748
Finally, he decided that my story must be true.
